### Project ignores
tmp/

# Worktree-discipline pack — installed from the livespec-dev-tooling package
# (the single canonical source) into dev-tooling/ at bootstrap, NEVER tracked
# here, mirroring how the commit-refuse hooks are installed into the untracked
# shared .git/hooks/ dir. The pack is six bodies plus a generated
# `dev-tooling/.gitignore`: the four executable shell scripts (`worktree-lib.sh`,
# `branch-protection.sh`, `gate-run.sh`, and `check-no-workflow-edits.sh` — the
# fleet's ONE workflow-edit guard, livespec-dev-tooling-fy02, which the
# `check-no-workflow-edits` recipe delegates to; NO tracked copy and NO
# environment-variable escape lives in this repo) plus the `worktree.just` and
# `branch-protection.just` recipe fragments the root justfile `import?`s.
# `just bootstrap` materializes them via the `worktree-pack` LOCAL obligation
# row.
/dev-tooling/worktree-lib.sh
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.sh
/dev-tooling/gate-run.sh
/dev-tooling/check-no-workflow-edits.sh
/dev-tooling/worktree.just
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.just
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.idea/

# Playwright MCP browser-tool scratch (page snapshots, console logs) —
# per-session, never durable state.
.playwright-mcp/

### Python toolchain artifacts
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*

### Node / TypeScript toolchain artifacts
# The ONE sanctioned pi extension this Driver ships is a TypeScript
# `tool_call`-blocking footgun guard (livespec SPECIFICATION/contracts.md
# §"Driver-shipped hooks"). Its build/dependency artifacts are never tracked.
node_modules/
dist/

### UV local state
.venv/

### pi package caches
# `.pi/settings.json` (the committed dogfooding config) is tracked; the git
# package clones `pi install ... -l` materializes under `.pi/git/` — each a
# full clone plus its own node_modules — are per-machine cache, never tracked.
.pi/git/

### Beads / Dolt
# Per-clone bd state (Dolt working copy, lockfiles, runtime artifacts,
# per-machine metadata.json) is excluded by .beads/.gitignore (tracked
# itself, once the tenant is provisioned). `.beads/config.yaml` IS tracked:
# it carries the server-mode connection block for the livespec-driver-pi
# Dolt tenant with NO per-machine project_id and NO password (the tenant
# password is supplied via the BEADS_DOLT_PASSWORD env var at bd-call time).
.beads-credential-key
*.env.local
